  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2dad1f93b8bed44786f04339ba57b27b6e912776.jpeg\" alt=\"cosmo_banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mfjZyHrWKp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/30ec02a0c24ff230847f55b7c68c7caf8a687a59_0.webp\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cosmopolitan</strong> 是一款专注于扩展食物多样性以及原版与各类模组兼容性的模组。虽然你可以单独游玩本模组，但搭配兼容模组后内容将更加丰富。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a944c21aa283e4c7250819e28d39b4b256b2a899.png\" alt=\"Items\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62bdd5b6bc77c3cf5b7b9b44e7c3354a6f85e33c_0.webp\" alt=\"Blocks\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4d188cc8950c7bf4e65c3884d44e737b5cdfee6.jpeg\" alt=\"cosmo-1\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>野莓、蕨菜嫩芽、小麦草、白桦树液、熊果莓和块茎。所有这些新食材均可通过原版方块获取。</li>\n<li>为苹果、胡萝卜和荧光浆果设计了全新的风味效果。</li>\n<li>流浪商人在此之后将出售一些特色食物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1e8d149b0b9bef3ebd6869ebbf6f3fc31cf3bbda_0.webp\" alt=\"cosmo-2\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新物品与方块：冰淇淋甜筒、冰淇淋三明治以及新的冰淇淋方块变体</li>\n<li>流体支持：允许将冰淇淋作为流体处理，并与机械动力（Create）配方集成</li>\n<li>冷冻甜点桶：全新方块，用于储存冰淇淋并以更具沉浸感的方式制作</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01d34938c2b4605cd6110b43994000cd793db7e9.jpeg\" alt=\"cosmo-3\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>围绕新增食材打造的新菜肴。</li>\n<li>四种全新季节性饮品。安装静谧四季（Serene Seasons）后，在对应季节饮用将提供有益的状态效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3cba49b542d2995aa5b206ca30b97a9165f1171_0.webp\" alt=\"cosmo-4\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>为地下花园（Undergarden）模组的起泡浆果（Blisterberry）和垂垂果（Droopfruit）设计了全新的风味效果。当玩家处于地下花园维度时，这些效果将提供额外增益。</li>\n<li>以浆果好味（Berry Good）风格优化了来自多个模组的其他浆果。</li>\n<li>一些随机的小特性：可再生的史莱姆糖果、进阶的牛奶替代品等&hellip;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>支持模组列表</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serene Seasons</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecliptic-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecliptic Seasons</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tough As Nails</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cookielicious\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cookielicious</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exquisito\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exquisito</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seasonals</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Peculiars</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respiteful\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respiteful</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns And Chasms</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/habitat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Habitat</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmers Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewin-and-chewin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brewin And Chewin</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectors-reap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Collectors Reap</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/casualness-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Casualness Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frycooks-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frycooks Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmers Respite</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miners-delight-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Miners Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seed-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seed Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilights Flavors Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-cookbook\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Cookbook</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kitchen-karrot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kitchen Karrot</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
